                                "sense_id": "f7f29a65-ddfe-3da3-a95e-b4435140fd4e",
                                "text": "Both ready, and on their guard; Burke evidently waiting for Byrne to commence; but incautiously putting down his hands to wipe them on his drawers, Byrne, as quick as lightning, popped in a snorter."
